---
// TEMPORARILY DISABLED (2026-08-10). Do not re-enable without either fixing
// or replacing the underlying bug — this is not a style choice.
//
// Root cause, confirmed by reproducing on production and bisecting against
// an unbundled load of the same package version: kokoro-js statically
// imports `phonemizer` (an Emscripten/WASM package, `import { phonemize }
// from 'phonemizer'`), and Astro/Vite's production bundling of that already
// pre-built package corrupts its language-voice data. `list_voices()` comes
// back with zero entries inside Kit-Bin's bundle, while the exact same call
// against `phonemizer` loaded fresh from a CDN returns 8 real voices — so
// every generation deterministically throws `Invalid language identifier:
// "en-us". Should be one of: .` after the ~80MB model finishes downloading.
// It is not a network flake or a bad input; it reproduces 100% of the time.
//
// This is the same *class* of bug that broke /pdf/scan-to-pdf's opencv-js
// import (see scanToPdf.ts's getCv() doc comment) — a bundler re-processing
// an already-bundled Emscripten/WASM library — but scan-to-pdf's fix
// (vendor the library as a static <script>-loaded asset, bypassing Vite's
// interop entirely) doesn't transfer directly here: `phonemizer` isn't
// imported by our own code, it's a *static* import inside kokoro-js's own
// dist file, so fixing it would mean patch-package-ing kokoro-js itself
// rather than changing an import site we control. That's real, scoped work
// someone should pick up deliberately, not a quick follow-on to this pass.
//
// Taken offline rather than left live and broken: with the ~80MB download
// already paid, every real visitor got a dead end with no way to retry
// into success. See docs/LICENSING.md's kokoro-js entry for the technical
// writeup. The lib module (src/lib/audio/textToSpeech.ts) and its FAQ copy
// are left completely intact — only this page's markup changed.
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ToolHeader from '../../components/ToolHeader.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Text to Speech Online, Free MP3 Download, No Sign-Up | Kit-Bin"
  description="Text to speech is temporarily unavailable while we fix an issue with the underlying speech model."
>
  <ToolHeader title="Text to Speech Online" subtitle="Temporarily unavailable." />

  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-amber-300/70 dark:border-amber-500/25 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/20 p-6 text-center">
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink dark:text-slate-100">This tool is temporarily offline.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted dark:text-slate-400">
        We found a bug in the on-device speech model that makes every generation fail after a long
        download, and we'd rather take it down than waste your time and data on something that
        won't work. We're working on a fix.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm">
        <a href="/audio/" class="text-primary dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">See the other audio tools →</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
